# 04_cliff_contraption (area 914f1381) layer 2: the Splitter fight - the chassis u0532, its head
# u0531, the second chassis u0521 and its head u0520. The helpers lane's run: the head's alive
# gate (fn_75_6310, 633C, 6368), the head's Listen (fn_75_5F18: the noise type and the distance)
# and the chassis's own flags (fn_75_E99C: the IM00 message sets 0xD41's 0x80 bit).
@f30 layer 2
@f120 objs
@f160 send u0532 Activate; send u0531 Activate
@f300 place u0531 player 5
@f360 noise 4
@f420 noise 3
@f480 noise 4 0 0 0
@f560 send u0532 0x494d3030
@f640 send u0521 Activate; send u0520 Activate
@f900 objs
@f1200 status
